sequenceDiagram
    actor Dev as Developer
    participant ADT as ADT console
    participant Cls as zcl_vkrap01_dt_demo_data
    participant DB as zvkrap01_dt_demo
    Dev->>ADT: Run as ABAP Application
    ADT->>Cls: if_oo_adt_classrun~main
    Cls->>Cls: build rows of all groups
    Cls->>DB: DELETE FROM
    Cls->>DB: MODIFY FROM TABLE
    loop each risky row
        Cls->>DB: MODIFY one row inside TRY
        DB-->>Cls: accepted or exception
    end
    Cls->>DB: SELECT COUNT
    DB-->>Cls: number of rows
    Cls-->>ADT: out->write
    ADT-->>Dev: console output
